*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*30 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
