**1 [[E-792]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
===Cheese Strategy===
This strategy involves letting [[Deathshund]] burrow as you isolate [[Kappy Jr.]] and jump him with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Tourist Cat]] to ensure Kappy doesn't get to attack. If you want, you can accompany Bahamut with other rushers and the Thunderbolt cannon. Once you have this setup, it all just comes down to stalling Deathshund with the likes of [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] or [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Macho]].

